   "name": "Mega Man 2: The Power Fighters",
   "genre": "Combat / Versus Co-op",
   "synopsis": "Quand Megaman devient un jeu de combat, on tient un titre fun et super plaisant à jouer. C'est ce que propose ce Megaman 2 : The Power Fighters, un jeu d'arcade court mais intense!",
   "synopsis_lang": "fr"
  },
  "en": {
   "name": "Mega Man 2: The Power Fighters",
   "genre": "Fighting / Vs Co-op",
   "synopsis": "Building upon the previous game, you must battle Dr. Wily's evil robot criminals with the help of Megaman, Protoman, Bass & Duo. Features cool 2-D graphics and the same tried & true Mega Man controls. Pay attention to Dr. Light's advice and you may reach Dr. Wily's fortress and come out victorious!",
   "synopsis_lang": "en"
  }
 },
